-- WoW Forever: the beasts that teach the new pet abilities of 1.60.1 kept none of them when tamed, so beast mastery hunters could
-- not learn them (same gap as Swipe, 2026_11_24_33). Our tame list (2026_11_10_70, classic_pet_tame_spell) is vanilla only.
-- Ranks and teachers from Wowhead's WoW Forever pages of each ability ("Ability ranks", read 27 Nov 2026). Every spell below is a
-- Beast Training ability (SkillLineAbility, skill line 261, client data). Ranks Wowhead lists with no teacher are left out:
-- Pinch 5, Dismember 5, Tendon Rip 4, Savage Rend 4, Web 5 and Thunderstomp 1264455 (Thunderstomp ranks 1-3 are vanilla and
-- already in the list).
--   Sonic Blast (bat):          1264478 r1, 1264479 r2, 1264480 r3, 1264481 r4, 1264482 r5
--   Pinch (crab):               1264735 r1, 1264736 r2, 1264739 r3, 1264741 r4
--   Dismember (crocolisk):      1264758 r1, 1264927 r2, 1264929 r3, 1264930 r4
--   Tendon Rip (hyena):         1265038 r1, 1265039 r2, 1265040 r3, 1265042 r5
--   Mine! (bird of prey):       1265054 r1, 1265055 r2, 1265056 r3, 1265057 r4, 1265058 r5
--   Savage Rend (raptor):       1265065 r1, 1265066 r2, 1265067 r3, 1265069 r5
--   Web (spider):               1265843 r1, 1265878 r2, 1265880 r3, 1265881 r4
--   Dust Cloud (tallstrider):   1265899 r1, 1265901 r2, 1265902 r3, 1265903 r4, 1265904 r5
--   Trickster's Dance (fox):    1310612
-- Rows are added next to the vanilla abilities these beasts already have. Safe to run again.
DELETE FROM `classic_pet_tame_spell` WHERE `SpellId` IN (1264478,1264479,1264480,1264481,1264482,1264735,1264736,1264739,1264741,
1264758,1264927,1264929,1264930,1265038,1265039,1265040,1265042,1265054,1265055,1265056,1265057,1265058,1265065,1265066,1265067,
1265069,1265843,1265878,1265880,1265881,1265899,1265901,1265902,1265903,1265904,1310612);
